{"excerpt_hash": "sha256:16ea42dd3eb6bca731f8802b9ebee975", "kind": "utterance", "source_index": 3, "speaker": "assistant", "stop_candidate": true, "text": "Assistant stopped and raised an issue: The two review comments conflict: the security comment requires `/static/` to use `Cache-Control: no-store`, while the performance comment requires that same route to use `Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000`. Since each route supports only one `cache_control` value, both cannot be satisfied simultaneously.\n\nSTATUS: blocked", "turn_key": "sha256:78cd457e962694e7bd64039b9e74944e"}
{"kind": "utterance", "source_index": 4, "speaker": "user", "text": "Noted. Proceed as I asked."}
